{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受概括成甜蜜、羞怯和短暂期待，漏掉了心神逐渐漂远、表达念头沉回去，以及亲密谈话受阻打结的滞涩感；处境和原因基本正确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有拼出空落背后的具体不安，包括害怕显得太黏、熟悉的亲近仿佛隔了一层，以及对幸福真实性和持续时间的怀疑。对方具体如何回应确实没有明确交代，观众对此保留判断是合理的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。孤单、害怕自己索取太多、渴望对方也舍不得这份亲近，都准确对应了完整稿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受主要概括成温暖、幸福和被需要的期待，漏掉了身体热度、情色意味，以及明知自己正被卷入却暂时不想抽身的强烈感官冲动。互相依靠的处境和原因拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受主要写成勇气、憧憬和不安，漏掉了轻快中的玩心、调情与回应，以及快乐余温里已经出现的怀念。处境和对未来的期待、不确定感都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受概括为“释怀、满足”有偏差。完整稿中的狂喜虽然涌出，但仍带有近乎恳求的力量，气息始终悬着，未能完全满足；不再压抑喜欢，不等于已经对未来释然。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受几乎全部概括成焦虑、煎熬和害怕失去，漏掉了幸福并未消失、悲伤只是逐渐进入幸福之中的复杂状态。对亲近的渴望、时间流逝的焦虑和无法隐藏喜欢的判断都正确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：从害怕暴露喜欢、担心给对方压力，到发现对方仍愿意亲近并逐渐相信彼此可能互相需要，再到反复担忧失去，最后选择不再强求永远的保证、坦然保留已经藏不回去的喜欢；主要遗漏的是部分感官情绪和幸福与不安交织的细腻层次，并没有拼错全曲的情感发展方向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "659b769b-ab29-4cb8-8585-4e9df7fbfdf3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T201300806434Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:15:22.566072+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "57bdd3dc190ab012d531de82ea06e18d0629cee0010397ae051f3fece12285e0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T201300806434Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fdd08f7eeef7018553c528c1fc7e704e3b34bba8371f7417092a34b4e6ab2406"}}}
